  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Grass_Overhaul/BH_GO_Header.webp\" alt=\"Grass Overhaul 标志\" width=\"982\" height=\"280\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"219\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><em><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-FABRIC, FORGE, QUILT-e0961d?style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&labelColor=030B14\" width=\"288\" height=\"78\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT ME-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ko-Fi&labelColor=030B14\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><strong>Grass Overhaul</strong>&nbsp;是一款装饰性与便利性（QoL）模组，添加了可堆叠的地毯状、半砖和完整草皮方块。</em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><em>这些草皮可用于打造更细致的地形，同时保留原版风格。它甚至兼容材质包。</em></em></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fELOCIN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Grass_Overhaul/BH_GO_Promo.webp\" alt=\"在Bisecthosting使用代码“ELOCIN”享受25%折扣\" width=\"982\" height=\"280\"></a><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Grass_Overhaul/BH_GO_Features.webp\" alt=\"特性\" width=\"984\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🌱 <strong>草皮方块、半砖与补丁 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🧱&nbsp;<strong>可堆叠的草皮补丁&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>🎨 无缝色彩</strong>.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✏️ <strong>材质包兼容性&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☀️ <strong>光影PBR兼容性&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ <strong>原版与模组地图兼容性。</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1083823318358032394/1085383437969534997/BH_GO_Frame.png\" alt=\"游戏内截图\" width=\"1093\" height=\"561\"></strong></span><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1104168106160574636/1161320166580293662/recipes.webp\" alt=\"合成表\" width=\"978\" height=\"489\"></p>",
